OL,5,G0930 Essential Classics
OL,6,     FIan Skelly plays the best in
OL,7,     Fclassical music, with discoveries
OL,8,     Fand surprises rubbing shoulders
OL,9,     Fwith familiar favourites.
OL,10,G1300 Classical Live
OL,11,     FLinton Stephens introduces
OL,12,     Fhighlights from the Proms,
OL,13,     Fincluding music by Beethoven &
OL,14,     FHaydn, plus brass music from the
OL,15,     FEdinburgh International Festival
OL,16,     Fand choral music from Prague.
OL,17,G1600 Composer of the Week: Mendelssohn
OL,18,     F1/5. Kate Molleson follows
OL,19,     FMendelssohn's early journeys, from
OL,20,     FBerlin salons to Alpine
OL,21,     Fadventures.
