OL,5,G1700 In Tune
OL,6,     FClare Hammond plays live and is
OL,7,     Fjoined by George Vass, ahead of
OL,8,     Fthe Presteigne Festival. Conductor
OL,9,     FCristian Macelaru on his BBC Prom.
OL,10,G1900 BBC Proms 2026
OL,11,     FLive at the BBC Proms: BBC
OL,12,     FNational Orchestra of Wales and
OL,13,     FRyan Bancroft perform with
OL,14,     Fclarinetist Anthony McGill.
OL,15,G2200 Night Tracks
OL,16,     FHannah Peel presents an
OL,17,     Fadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,18,     Ffor late-night listening, from
OL,19,     Fclassical to contemporary and
OL,20,     Feverything in between.
